{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey begins in a decaying oil refinery, where rusted pipes, toxic spills, and collapsing steel walkways are only the start of your troubles. From there, you\u2019ll dive deeper into a post-apocalyptic labyrinth of traps, machines, and bizarre enemies\u2014all standing between you and the downfall of Owe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don\u2019t underestimate Ballboy. What he lacks in sleek design, he makes up for with <strong>fluid, skill-based movement</strong>. You\u2019ll jump, roll, and slide through intricate platforming challenges, chaining together smooth animations that reward precision and creativity. Every dodge, leap, and wall-slide is responsive and satisfying, making traversal just as fun as the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655020/extras/547d990ae6378824b4426fc75a3821e8.poster.avif?t=1761009216\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655020/extras/547d990ae6378824b4426fc75a3821e8.webm?t=1761009216\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655020/extras/547d990ae6378824b4426fc75a3821e8.mp4?t=1761009216\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Agile Platforming:</strong> Master Ballboy\u2019s unique round-bodied movement to outmaneuver traps, scale collapsing structures, and infiltrate enemy strongholds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Villain with Feathers:</strong> Face off against <strong>Owe the Owl</strong>, an arrogant overlord whose fortress is packed with mechanical minions and cruel contraptions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Environments:</strong> Explore the ruins of a post-apocalyptic oil refinery and beyond, each level layered with hazards, secrets, and challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smooth Animation:</strong> Every roll, jump, and slide flows seamlessly for a satisfying sense of momentum and control.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Stakes, Low Center of Gravity:</strong> You may be round and chubby, but you\u2019re faster, trickier, and braver than you look.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655020/extras/bb19d710bbe8433d550e632e90aa1d04.poster.avif?t=1761009216\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655020/extras/bb19d710bbe8433d550e632e90aa1d04.webm?t=1761009216\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655020/extras/bb19d710bbe8433d550e632e90aa1d04.mp4?t=1761009216\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655020/extras/dfd0c9e2ae0621511b4e7f1057bb91f5.poster.avif?t=1761009216\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655020/extras/dfd0c9e2ae0621511b4e7f1057bb91f5.webm?t=1761009216\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655020/extras/dfd0c9e2ae0621511b4e7f1057bb91f5.mp4?t=1761009216\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><